        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_80e0f33e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "黎那汐塔第一次黑潮爆发后，彻地之楔被激活，其力场有效限制了狩原上空的黑潮云，使之难以向七丘城区蔓延。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e61ab586",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "受其牵制，衍自黑潮云的黑潮也多被封锁、抑制于狩原底层。",
      "annotations": {
